{"id":"439222","name":"肉末荠菜豆腐羹","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/439222/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"300克"},{"name":"荠菜","amount":"30克"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"50克"}],"sub":[{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：荠菜。","img":"images/439222/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐。","img":"images/439222/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉末。","img":"images/439222/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水淀粉。","img":"images/439222/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将豆腐撕开包装倒扣在盘中，用刀划开，待用。","img":"images/439222/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将荠菜摘去黄叶烂叶洗净、捞出。","img":"images/439222/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放在案板上切碎，待用。","img":"images/439222/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入肉末，加点料酒翻炒至变色。","img":"images/439222/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"接着，合入豆腐加适量的清水煮开。","img":"images/439222/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后，合入荠菜翻动一下。","img":"images/439222/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后，倒入水淀粉勾芡，加点盐、鸡精。","img":"images/439222/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"调味翻匀，即成。","img":"images/439222/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}